# A run that clears the sign bit of a value whose range is unknown is its
# remainder mod 2^15 in a 16-bit and; in a 64-bit mask of more runs,
# where 2^63 is no modulus, it is refused, the parameter's address a
# uniform variable.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/and_sign_remainder.ptx | FileCheck "%s"
CHECK: kernel micro_and_sign_b16
CHECK: st.global.u32  global store 4 B  warp: 1 sector (ideal 1)
CHECK-SAME: [param_0 + 4 * (param_1 mod 32768)]
CHECK: kernel micro_and_sign_wide_runs
CHECK: st.global.u32  global store 4 B  warp: 1 sector (ideal 1)
CHECK-SAME: [4 * uniform(%rd3@51) + param_0]
